{"unit_id":"topkie__dsh-lattice#card-zh","repo":"topkie/dsh-lattice","commit":"a1f6ee42a96b023639e8e9d79fcc4f1da9121aad","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lattice 是面向 DSH 的本地记忆插件，通过五个工具和设置界面管理长期可复用的知识。它将记忆整理为带主题和关联的条目，支持显式写入、按语义或词面召回、展开全文、按条件浏览，以及归档和导出。写入时可补充检索入口与关系，修订旧记忆时可标记取代关系；召回会综合向量、入口词、正文和关联图。适合希望跨会话保存决定、经验和项目知识的 DSH 用户。数据存于本机 SQLite；首次启用向量召回会下载模型权重，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:472-529","src/tools/index.ts:201-260","src/tools/index.ts:469-510","src/pipeline/search.ts:886-920"]}
{"unit_id":"topkie__dsh-lattice#card-en","repo":"topkie/dsh-lattice","commit":"a1f6ee42a96b023639e8e9d79fcc4f1da9121aad","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lattice is a DSH plugin for saving reusable knowledge locally. Its tools support writing, natural language recall, expanding entries, and filtered browsing. Recall combines vectors, phrases, text, and graph links. Data stays in SQLite; model weights download on first use. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:472-529","src/tools/index.ts:201-260","src/tools/index.ts:469-510","src/pipeline/search.ts:886-920"]}
